Subject: [PATCH 226/230] Tables: drop Browse view and dead clubs rail;
 scrollable league tabs, sticky 6-col header with form dots and zone bars
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Removing the Browse (مرور) switch and view, the "باشگاه‌های شما" rail
(when the user follows no clubs the table itself just leads now, star
plus row tint inside the table when they do), and the single-option
"جدول" segmented control. League tabs scroll horizontally with a fade on
the hidden edge (direction-aware for both RTL and LTR). The column
header pins under the topbar; rows carry a 3px start-edge zone bar
(per-league config map, ESPN gives no zone metadata) and last-5 form
dots folded from stored matches. Legend line under the table.

🤖 Generated with Codebuff
